# Hexadecimal text encoding. The clean uniform interface; the per-env native implementation is selected at build time and hidden behind the API.

load @term/seed/code/native/text/hex
  find to-hex
  find from-hex

task encode
  take input, like text
  like text
  send back
    call to-hex
      read input

task decode
  take input, like text
  like text
  send back
    call from-hex
      read input
